## What you'll leave with

- **A stranger's record of your front door:** every place your docs stalled someone, in their words.
- **Your classmates' read on your demo:** what it proved, what it only showed, and what they still want to know.
- **A top-five fix list**, ranked. It's the studio agenda from here to launch, and whatever on it you don't fix goes in your known issues.

